an Fusion","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Vegetarian","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6dXONUFQwVBEy5rjuqyatw","review_id":"_rx2mGTtMlNjgp6ML-Rk4w","date":"2019-11-07T01:43:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371443390846252,"text_excerpt":"tl;dr New York bagels (seriously, they are boiled in NYC and then baked here) with a super thick schmear at a great price. Plus, vegetarian and vegan lunch offerings? Who would of thought such a well curated convenience store could come in such a small package. I was looking for a grab and go breakfast in the area on Yelp and saw this place pop up for bagels and I was intrigued. With super positive reviews I knew we had to check it out (Yelp rarely steers me wrong). Hot damn! A huge variety of bagels welcomed us when we entered. Poppy seed, everything, egg, cinnamon raisin, blueberry, whole wheat and more. Cream cheese options included original, chive and scallion, curry, honey walnut, su..."},{"business_id":"6dXONUFQwVBEy5rjuqyatw","review_id":"_p7EB8R0Adn8sUBD4dMibg","date":"2019-04-30T21:50:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9338752627372742,"text_excerpt":"Love this little shop! I eat breakfast here on my way to work almost every day. They make their bagels and cream cheese spreads fresh in-house as well as a variety of delicious vegan treats both savory (samosas, curry, pakora, veggie burgers, vegan pO-boys) and sweet (cookies, peanut butter brownies, etc) also can't beat their $1 cups of coffee and hot tea :)"},{"business_id":"6dXONUFQwVBEy5rjuqyatw","review_id":"KctrmJGnYLzcgKIwOYHRAA","date":"2020-07-03T16:07:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326273798942566,"text_excerpt":"Where do I even begin?!? Small mart is amazing, the owner works super hard and is always there. He managed to stay open and adapt during the entire Covid business closures and he did it in a safe very clean way. This place is great to begin with, they have tons of vegan and vegetarian options, kombucha on tap, NYC bagels and arguably the best bagels in NOLA. They've got curry that's fresh and really good, plus you can't beat the price. They have vegan goodies too. During Covid you'll have to wait longer than normal but trust me it's worth it."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
